<title>SWEDEN: TENNIS-SWEDEN LEAD SOUTH AFRICA 2-1 DAVIS CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SWEDEN LEAD SOUTH AFRICA 2-1 DAVIS CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>VAXJO, SWEDEN 1997-04-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden lead South Africa 2-1 in their Davis Cup World Group second round tie after victory in the doubles on Saturday.</p>
<p>Result:</p>
<p>Jonas Bjorkman/Nicklas Kulti beat David Adams/Ellis Ferreira 7-5 2-6 6-4 6-7 (6-8) 6-2</p>
